      "description": "Only Image plus Valid mask is measured HDR; Display fills are review-only.",
      "documentation": "<p>Response-aware weighted radiance with conservative exposure consistency. Image is zero outside measured support. Display may fill those pixels from the reference, marked separately. Align exposures first. This is a photometric motion proxy, not native Debevec/Robertson merging or radiometric certification. See docs/hdr-motion.md.</p>",
